    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Finalise and publish procurement pack",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that contracting authorities may reserve the right to participate in public procurement procedures to sheltered workshops and economic operators (i.e. suppliers) whose main aim is the integration of disabled or disadvantaged persons. Contracting authorities may also provide that contracts must be performed in the context of sheltered employment programmes. At least 30% of the employees of those workshops, suppliers or programmes must be disabled.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where public contracts are reserved in accordance with regulation 20, the call for competition must make a reference to this regulation (i.e. regulation 20).",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "clearly identify in the call for competition whether participation in the procurement is reserved in accordance with the provisions of this regulation (i.e. regulation 20).",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 9,
